            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa succede quando la condizione di questo ciclo <code>while</code> rimane <code>True</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il ciclo si ripete all'infinito e manda in crash il programma</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il ciclo esegue il suo blocco di codice una volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il ciclo si ripete all'infinito e manda in crash il programma.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice continua a visualizzare lo stesso messaggio?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Polly wants a cracker!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Polly wants a cracker!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Looks like your code runs forever. It may be that an infinite loop exists in your code.\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La condizione resta <code>True</code>, quindi il ciclo continua a eseguire il blocco.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Chiamare <code>print()</code> riavvia il programma dopo ogni messaggio.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un ciclo <code>while</code> ignora sempre la sua condizione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La condizione resta <code>True</code>, quindi il ciclo continua a eseguire il blocco.</p></body></html>"
